# Warden's native checks by parity: #126 the mark and Shadow Pursuit.
# Warden a against Warden b; syntax and checks: smashcraft:docs/native-bot-session.md.
#! chat -dev quick hero warden
# b dashes in to about 280 away, within Shadow Pursuit's reach; eda5e178f2 made Maiev grippier, so b holds the dash 3 frames (variant run 39025469042).
40 b stick -1 0
43 b stick 0 0
# Counterplay: b's held shield takes Shadow Strike, so no mark.
50 b shield 1
60 a tap X 2
140 b shield 0
# Shadow Strike marks b.
200 a tap X 2
# Shadow Pursuit appears behind the marked b and slashes.
290 a stick 1 0
290 a tap X 2
291 a stick 0 0
# The mark is spent: the next side special, back toward b, is the plain Pursuit Lunge.
440 a stick -1 0
440 a tap X 2
441 a stick 0 0
# Fan of Knives.
# View held a second: the first of two moments the parity check replays.
500 a press VIEW
570 a release VIEW
600 a stick 0 -1
600 a tap X 2
601 a stick 0 0
# Expected, frame by frame (headless run of this script):
#! expect a 60 special 13 form 0
#! absent b 60-199 damage
#! expect a 200 special 13 form 0
# 1ed1f22499 (#414 step 3) set Shadow Strike to 3.816 and Pursuit to 7.633; the lighter hits shorten hitlag, so Pursuit ends a frame sooner.
# a6a7bb6119 (#188) brakes b's dash slide under its raised shield, so Shadow Strike lands a frame later and Pursuit
# stops 9.6 further on (probe with that brake neutralised keeps 229, 289 and 133.715; trace: run 40099478236).
#! expect b 230 damage 3.816
#! expect b 290 damage 4.816 hitlag 0 hitstun 0
#! expect a 290 special 14 form 4
#! expect b 307 damage 12.449
#! expect a 333 special 0 form 4 action-frame 0 x 143.315
#! expect a 440 special 14 form 0
# #273 made Pursuit Lunge cut through what it passes; #487 holds its windup through frame 13, so the lunge on 440 meets b on 453, stuns it and turns a to face it from its far side.
#! expect b 453 damage 20.082
#! expect a 600 special 16 form 0
# #272 gave Fan of Knives Immolate's frames 4-7 and a set knockback at a low angle, so it hits on 603 and poisons from there.
#! expect b 603 damage 26.188
#! expect b 603 launch up 1 from-air 0 x 10.432 z 2.795
#! expect b 663 damage 27.188 hitlag 0 hitstun 0
1000 a press VIEW
1070 a release VIEW
